  "label": "Al Pacino as a threatening or morally authoritative figure",
  "description": "Al Pacino is widely recognized in popular culture for portraying intense, morally complex, and often intimidating characters, such as Michael Corleone in 'The Godfather' or Frank Serpico in 'Serpico'. His image in this meme leverages this established cinematic persona to convey a sense of authority, vengeance, and unyielding justice, which is essential to understanding the threatening tone of the overlaid text.",
